# 3. Initial Ingress Configuration

The first Ingress used a hostname:

```yaml
host: html.local
```

The backend was:

```text
html-service:80
```

The Ingress looked conceptually like:

```yaml
apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1
kind: Ingress
metadata:
  name: html-ingress
  annotations:
    nginx.ingress.kubernetes.io/rewrite-target: /
spec:
  ingressClassName: nginx
  rules:
  - host: html.local
    http:
      paths:
      - path: /
        pathType: Prefix
        backend:
          service:
            name: html-service
            port:
              number: 80
```

