# 4. First 404 Problem

When accessing:

```text
http://20.15.171.215
```

we received:

```text
404 Not Found
nginx
```

The reason was the hostname rule.

The Ingress expected:

```http
Host: html.local
```

But Chrome accessing the IP sends approximately:

```http
Host: 20.15.171.215
```

Therefore:

```text
Host: 20.15.171.215
        |
        v
NGINX Ingress
        |
        X
No matching host rule
        |
        v
404 Not Found
```

